  "settings.magicPrompts.page.group.sessionCatchUp.description": "/catch-up e\u011fik \u00e7izgi komutu taraf\u0131ndan kullan\u0131lan istemler: g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr kullan\u0131c\u0131 iletisi + gizli y\u00f6nergeler. Ne yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 anlamak i\u00e7in dal\u0131n commit\u2019lerini, PR\u2019sini ve commit edilmemi\u015f \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 bir araya getiren dal fark\u0131ndal\u0131kl\u0131 bir ba\u011flam olu\u015fturur; ard\u0131ndan sindirilebilir bir \u00f6zet ve \u00fcr\u00fcne odakl\u0131 bir sonraki ad\u0131m verir.",
  "settings.magicPrompts.page.group.sessionDebug.title": "Hata ay\u0131klama",
  "settings.magicPrompts.page.group.sessionDebug.description": "/debug e\u011fik \u00e7izgi komutu taraf\u0131ndan kullan\u0131lan istemler: g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr kullan\u0131c\u0131 iletisi + gizli y\u00f6nergeler. Belirtiyi yakalayan, hipotezler olu\u015fturan, bunlar\u0131 kodla kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131ran ve bir d\u00fczeltme \u00f6nermeden \u00f6nce nedeni do\u011frulayan y\u00f6nlendirilmi\u015f bir k\u00f6k neden ara\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131 y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fcr.",
